.TH TRUSTC "1" "April 2026" "trustc <INSERT VERSION HERE>" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
trustc \- The Trust compiler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B trustc
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIINPUT\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBtrustc\fR is the canonical compiler binary for the Trust toolchain. It
preserves inherited Rust language compatibility while exposing Trust-owned
strict batteries-on native verification. Use \fB-Z trust-verify=off\fR only for
an explicit vanilla-compatibility compilation; use \fBtargo trust\fR for the
normal Cargo-aware verification workflow.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR trustdoc (1)
